e used as the excuse for martial law.&lt;br /&gt;All the people who enthusiastically voted for their destroyer can enjoy the hope and change they clamored for.&lt;br /&gt;In Venezuela the military is shooting people while they chant we want food.&lt;br /&gt;Coming soon to a fading banana republic near you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/452779460011184988'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/452779460011184988'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html?showComment=1466055465794#c452779460011184988' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6932158114646502535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6932158114646502535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-742062664"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 15, 2016 at 11:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5104591231201346416</id><published>2016-06-15T16:25:26.889-06:00</published><updated>2016-06-15T16:25:26.889-06:00</updated><title type='text'>http://ww&#xa;&#xa;thousenews.com/2016/06/13/oregon-occupi...</title><content type='html'>http://ww&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;thousenews.com/2016/06/13/oregon-occupiers-cleared-of-most-serious-charge.htm&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Will dismissal of the &amp;quot;intimidation of federal agents with firearms&amp;quot; charges from the Malheur Co. incident apply to nearly identical charges against those at the Nevada cattle rescue incident?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Our computer left us, so must fiddle out a comment on this tiny tablet.  We are ever nearer to a state of absolute noncommunication.  The snare is sprung!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Donna - North Dakota</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/5104591231201346416'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/5104591231201346416'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html?showComment=1466029526889#c5104591231201346416' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6932158114646502535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6932158114646502535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-516437479"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 15, 2016 at 4:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-875862516906350338</id><published>2016-06-14T16:31:29.414-06:00</published><updated>2016-06-14T16:31:29.414-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There has not been much media coverage of a neighb...</title><content type='html'>There has not been much media coverage of a neighbor of mine, who the feds have arrested and are now trying for his involvement in the Bundy Ranch standoff... I wish all the best for former marine and freedom fighter Jerry DeLemus... &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;According to The Portsmouth Patch, former N.H. GOP chair Jack Kimball, who claimed to have spoken to Rep. Susan DeLemus about the arrest, wrote on Facebook, “She said that the FBI just rolled up with lots of vehicles and Agents who were in tactical gear. They forced their way into Jerry Delemus and Sue’s condo with weapons drawn and arrested Jerry and took him away.”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kimball characterized Jerry DeLemus as “a good and Patriotic Marine” who “is now being prosecuted for standing up for Liberty.” He called for “New Hampshire patriots” to “protest this tyranny in the most visible way possible.”</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/875862516906350338'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/875862516906350338'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html?showComment=1465943489414#c875862516906350338' title=''/><author><name>Steveo Van Damm</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17763419838128529170</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/-ghDSSkFlcBA/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAABg/ZCAHmYucz4M/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6932158114646502535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6932158114646502535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1372258203"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 14, 2016 at 4:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4477078343797858974</id><published>2016-06-14T09:23:56.858-06:00</published><updated>2016-06-14T09:23:56.858-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There was a third suicide in the Indian Artifacts ...</title><content type='html'>There was a third suicide in the Indian Artifacts farce, too. http://www.nytimes.com/2010/03/09/us/09artifacts.html?_r=0 ----&amp;gt; http://query.nytimes.com/gst/fullpage.html?res=9506E5DA1431F932A15755C0A96F9C8B63&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;On Friday, a second defendant, Steven L. Shrader of Santa Fe, N.M., was found dead of two self-inflicted gunshot wounds behind an elementary school in DeKalb County, Ill., according to the authorities there. Mr. Shrader, 56, had turned himself in to law enforcement officials in Albuquerque after being served a warrant in the case.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Good story. Tragedy for all involved in the BLM rampage. Haste the day.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/4477078343797858974'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/4477078343797858974'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html?showComment=1465917836858#c4477078343797858974' title=''/><author><name>Joshua Cottle</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14142752222806140466</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='24' height='32' src='//4.bp.blogspot.com/-2hkelFCkvg4/VM_ckBMWI2I/AAAAAAAAARg/b9YYyMn_I80/s113/*'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6932158114646502535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6932158114646502535' type='te