omment=1465685891004#c3780651432450245692' title=''/><author><name>Thomas Lowe</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17856536324144959692</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6932158114646502535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6932158114646502535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-255013287"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 11, 2016 at 4:58 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8518873910078659810</id><published>2016-06-11T15:55:01.936-06:00</published><updated>2016-06-11T15:55:01.936-06:00</updated><title type='text'>You know I really wish we had 50 million WNG in th...</title><content type='html'>You know I really wish we had 50 million WNG in the USSA. Seriously, he has always been one of my favorite writers, back when he was with the JBS. He took the TRUTH too seriously for them. I don&amp;#39;t like the way the Mormon church has turned over the years, was never one of them, but I&amp;#39;ve met a handful of REAL Christians, by their actions, over the years and, oddly enough, two of the handful were Mormons, now whether they were active or not I don&amp;#39;t know.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The USSA government is the #1 ENEMY of heartland Americans. Not Putin, Not Assad of Syria.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And &amp;quot;hate crimes&amp;quot; aka &amp;quot;Thought Crimes&amp;quot; show you that the government of America is not what it is supposed to be it is a Bolshevik country. We shall leave the perpetrators of this throughout the world for each reader to determine for himself.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;WNG, you are, &lt;i&gt;truly&lt;/i&gt; a PATRIOT.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/8518873910078659810'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/8518873910078659810'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html?showComment=1465682101936#c8518873910078659810' title=''/><author><name>Sven</name><uri>http://gunowners.org/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/06/the-peacemaker-and-psychopath.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6932158114646502535' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6932158114646502535' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1148484672"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 11, 2016 at 3:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5904033818763180940</id><published>2016-06-11T15:26:26.020-06:00</published><updated>2016-06-11T15:26:26.020-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The title to this story would be better suited, Th...</title><content type='html'>The title to this story would be better suited, The Peaceful Citizen Attacked by the System of The Psyshopaths.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/5904033818763180940'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6932158114646502535/comments/default/5904033818763180940'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominour